@mock = http://localhost:5080

### Start clean: reseed stores, clear log and faults
POST {{mock}}/admin/reset

### HRIS: get seeded employee (200)
GET {{mock}}/hris/employees/E-1001

### HRIS: unknown employee (404)
GET {{mock}}/hris/employees/E-9999

### Care: first upsert creates (201)
PUT {{mock}}/care/workers/E-1001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "given_name": "Alice",
  "family_name": "Smith",
  "email": "alice.smith@example.com",
  "phone": "+1-555-0101",
  "role": "Caregiver",
  "start_date": "2026-11-02"
}

### Care: same upsert again updates (200)
PUT {{mock}}/care/workers/E-1001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "given_name": "Alice",
  "family_name": "Smith",
  "email": "alice.smith@example.com",
  "phone": "+1-555-0101",
  "role": "Caregiver",
  "start_date": "2026-11-02"
}

### Care: list shows exactly one worker
GET {{mock}}/care/workers

### Care: missing given_name/family_name (400 validation problem)
PUT {{mock}}/care/workers/E-1002
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "given_name": "",
  "family_name": "  ",
  "role": "Scheduler"
}

### Faults: next 3 care requests fail with 503 + Retry-After: 2
PUT {{mock}}/admin/faults/care
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fail_next": 3,
  "status_code": 503,
  "retry_after_seconds": 2
}

### Care: run 4 times -> 503, 503, 503, 200
GET {{mock}}/care/workers/E-1001

### Faults: next 2 hris requests fail with 429
PUT {{mock}}/admin/faults/hris
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fail_next": 2,
  "status_code": 429,
  "retry_after_seconds": 1
}

### HRIS: run 3 times -> 429, 429, 200
GET {{mock}}/hris/employees/E-1002

### Faults: every hris request takes 3000 ms (no failures)
PUT {{mock}}/admin/faults/hris
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fail_next": 0,
  "delay_ms": 3000
}

### HRIS: slow (~3 s) but 200
GET {{mock}}/hris/employees/E-1001

### Faults: view rules and remaining failures
GET {{mock}}/admin/faults

### Request log (injected failures marked "(injected)")
GET {{mock}}/admin/requests

### Reset stores, log and faults
POST {{mock}}/admin/reset
